{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">伯恩斯坦：东京电子一季度毛利率46.8%上行早于预期</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">东京电子（Tokyo Electron）<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>财报最值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的信号，不是收入本身，而是毛利率的节奏。收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7324亿</span>日元，同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">33%</span>，略低于市场预期；但毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">46.8%</span>、营业利润率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28.9%</span>，双双高于共识。管理层同时将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>年WFE市场预期从1700亿美元上调至1900亿美元，并把AI之外的传统DRAM和CPU也列为增长来源。这份报告的核心判断是：东京电子的盈利上行比市场原先认为的更早、更陡。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">，隐含<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">52%</span>的上行空间。估值倍数反而从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">32倍</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28倍</span>，说明上调主要来自盈利预测修正，而非估值<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY27</span>/3财年营收预测上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY28</span>/3上调20%；营业利润分别上调11%和41%。这些数字放在一起，指向一个更清晰的结论：市场此前对东京电子的利润率假设偏保守。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVOnVvtia9Cd4ias7Cicn1iaic3yTLRfHy4BD3dhJtW2duuJ2edkZv4IiaE8KUIzqZMHoUHJzDHj5J6ibKXibYeO3GowvmV7tYxMkK6W9A/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>以上的时间点比预期提前一年</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层确认，提价带来的毛利率提升将从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>开始体现，下个财年初即可实现<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>以上的毛利率目标。这比读者预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY29</span>/3早了近一年。报告认为，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>以上毛利率和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35%</span>以上营业利润率之后还有进一步上行空间。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这一判断的支撑来自产品结构。涂胶显影设备和刻蚀设备合计贡献超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>的收入增长，先进封装由探针台驱动。管理层预计这两类设备年收入可达<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1万亿</span>日元。毛利率提升不是一次性因素，而是产品组合和定价能力共同作用的结果。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>：</strong> 毛利率时间点提前是这份报告最值得关注的变量。市场此前把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>毛利率当作远期目标，现在管理层说下个财年初就能到。如果兑现，盈利预测需要整体<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>，而不只是东京电子一家的问题。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUtFkyExRWe6QRcIJ5f7bJ56QvTtZuPFRC7Vz6aAsrgZQWXNN84ovPgHshKiaUNCVcKkPZFUUDp4VvxASoC5kmm5Ho4SXAL2D3Q/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2.业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">东京电子将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>年WFE市场预期从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1700亿美元</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1900亿美元</span>，理由是AI需求之外，传统DRAM和CPU也进入增长通道。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年WFE仍维持<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1500亿美元</span>不变。分应用看，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>逻辑/代工同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>，DRAM增长超过30%，NAND增长40%，整体约20%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>分应用表现分化明显。逻辑/代工收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3028亿</span>日元，同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19.8%</span>，但低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>预期<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.8%</span>；DRAM收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1700亿</span>日元，同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">65.5%</span>，低于预期10.1%；NAND收入584亿日元，同比增48%，基本符合预期。DRAM的高增长和逻辑/代工的相对温和增长，说明当前设备需求的结构正在变化。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUgwrPXfPKlaicjVsicHyPykbGekLJZLl2IINukRZFAwvPPactG1LUPC5oy3BFtGK2Niaq4K779avHTia1KqZPHGAJ2iaBbmgPB6FFk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3.业务与季度数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>隐含指引显示，收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8876亿</span>日元，较此前指引上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>，较市场预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.6%</span>；营业利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2466亿</span>日元，较此前指引上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.3%</span>，较市场预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>。新设备收入7087亿日元，较市场预期高14.8%，其中逻辑/代工和DRAM分别较市场预期高14.4%和17.5%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">上半年销售同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">37%</span>，管理层表示下半年将“显著超过上半年”，隐含全年增长超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">37%</span>。这一增速对应的不是市场共识的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">33.5%</span>，而是更接近<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>新预测的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">39.6%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXVM6o8I14kOhMj1ywwUPESaAnkCfZxIJwicDsMYqCw5D4xBicSeOSKATmITJ7wDy0SU4hXRFC67pG3ANb2DgRFSCpvSHtUdoCEc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 11-Bernstein-Tokyo Electron Ltd-8035.JP-TEL 1Q27 3-Margin upside materializing sooner-Lifting</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
